{"id":"TKR 2026 Q3","t":"TKR","d":"2026-11-04","time":"bmo","w":10107,"n":95,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/timken-tkr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[5,5,0,5.04],"pricing_power":[2,2,0,2.02],"cost_cuts":[2,1,1,2.02],"guidance":[2,2,0,2.02,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":1,"cut":1}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0781,"r5":-0.0559,"r1_spy":-0.0946,"r5_spy":-0.0501}}],"quotes":[{"c":"TKR 2018 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2019-02-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"Tariffs and costs were headwinds, which we slightly more than offset through pricing and cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/timken-co-tkr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2018 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2019-02-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"It was a dynamic cost year with unplanned tariffs and tight global labor and supply markets, but we more than offset the cost increases and we responded to the 13% organic demand increase efficiently.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/timken-co-tkr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2018 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2019-02-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"We have price increases in place for the full year of 2019, and with two months left in the quarter, we expect first quarter organic revenue growth above 5% before currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/timken-co-tkr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2018 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2019-02-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"We delivered organic growth of around 9%, reflecting continued strength across most end markets and sectors, plus the benefit of our outgrowth initiatives and positive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/timken-co-tkr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2018 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2019-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"Cost savings will partially mitigate these increases and then pricing will slightly more than offset the rest.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/timken-co-tkr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2018 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2019-02-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"So we've -- I got to overcome that, but as Rich mentioned, with some of the cost reduction initiatives that that were put in place in our plants around the world, we would expect to offset a fair amount of that impact, if you will, and then still deliver the 100 basis points margin expansion with…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/07/timken-co-tkr-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2020-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Barger","x":"And then last, just more of a philosophical question about we've had the combination of tariffs and now the virus.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/timken-co-tkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2020-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"But I certainly think the volatility we've seen from the tariff situation and the virus has certainly certainly will accelerate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/timken-co-tkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"On the positive side, we had favorable price/mix, lower material and logistics costs and lower SG&A expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/timken-co-tkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"Organically, sales were down 7.5%, driven by declines in global industrial distribution and the general and heavy industrial sectors partially offset by strong growth in renewable energy and positive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/timken-co-tkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"We came into the year with a good pipeline of cost reduction activities, the partial results of which were evident in our first quarter margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/timken-co-tkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"This includes $0.05 of net special charges related to restructuring and other items.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/timken-co-tkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2020-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"But certainly, if by the time we work our way through this quarter, if they have a lower outlook on the second half than what they had maybe back in February remarks, they will reduce inventory, and we will see some impact from that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/timken-co-tkr-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"The modest decline in adjusted EBITDA reflects the impact of lower volume and unfavorable price mix, as negative mix more than offset positive pricing in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/timken-co-tkr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"Organically sales were down 0.6% as strong growth in renewable energy and positive pricing largely offset declines across other sectors, including industrial distribution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/timken-co-tkr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"RICHARD G. KYLE","x":"We delivered solid EBITDA margins of over 19% with good operating performance, positive price, and benefits cost reduction initiatives all contributing to the results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/timken-co-tkr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"RICHARD G. KYLE","x":"With the onset of the Coronavirus, we [Indecipherable] various initiatives and added an SG&A right sizing initiative in the third quarter, we continue to have a healthy level of activities around reducing structural costs in manufacturing and SG&A. The bottom line is that we are confident that…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/timken-co-tkr-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2021-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"The slight decline in adjusted EBITDA reflects the impact of lower volume and unfavorable price/mix as negative mix more than offset positive pricing in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/timken-co-tkr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2021-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"Organically, sales were down 1.4% driven by declines in distribution and other industrial sectors, offset mostly by strong growth in renewable energy, higher marine revenue and positive pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/timken-co-tkr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"We also continued to benefit from ongoing cost-reduction actions and other productivity initiatives across our footprint, which more than offset some cost headwinds related to production ramp-ups, including at our new bearing manufacturing facility in the Americas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/timken-co-tkr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2020 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"And finally, on the SG&A line, we saw a significant reduction in expense versus last year, which reflects the benefit of structural cost-reduction initiatives and lower discretionary spending.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/timken-co-tkr-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2021 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"So in the majority of those contracts, whether they're annual or multi years, we have some mechanism to pass through some part of that steel inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/timken-co-tkr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2021 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard G. Kyle","x":"But also, there's a natural hedge with volume going up with it, and then we pass it through with time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/timken-co-tkr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2021 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"We also continued to benefit from ongoing cost reduction actions and other productivity initiatives across our footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/timken-co-tkr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2021 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"And finally, on the SG&A line, we saw a reduction in expense versus last year as we continued to benefit from cost reduction initiatives and lower discretionary spending, which more than offset the impact of higher incentive compensation expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/timken-co-tkr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2021 Q1","e":"tkr","d":"2021-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Philip D. Fracassa","x":"So to summarize, we delivered record first quarter performance and are raising the outlook for the rest of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/timken-co-tkr-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rich Kyle","x":"Adjusted EBITDA margins came in at 17.7%, and adjusted EPS was $1.42, both below prior year driven by lower volumes, higher tariff costs, and unfavorable currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/timken-tkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rich Kyle","x":"The tariff situation remains volatile, but our large U.S. manufacturing footprint will serve us well to adapt to the changes, and we remain confident in our ability to mitigate the direct impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/timken-tkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rich Kyle","x":"Pricing was up sequentially compared to the first quarter, and we expect further price realization as we move through the second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/timken-tkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Philip Fracassa","x":"We are successfully passing through higher tariff costs into the marketplace through pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/timken-tkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rich Kyle","x":"Additionally, The Timken Company will benefit next year from wins in the marketplace, as well as the carryover of pricing and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/timken-tkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Philip Fracassa","x":"Looking at material and logistics, material was notably lower versus last year, due in part to cost savings tactics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/timken-tkr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mike Dicenza","x":"We achieved nearly 40% incremental margins in the quarter, driven by improved operating performance more than offsetting the dilutive impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mike Dicenza","x":"Looking at the year-over-year change in adjusted EBITDA dollars, you can see the increase was driven collectively by several factors, which more than offset the impact of lower volume and incremental gross tariff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Dicenza","x":"On price/mix, pricing was positive in the quarter, while mix was negative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Dicenza","x":"So I'd say we've been largely successful passing through pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Dicenza","x":"Moving to the SG&A other line, expenses were down from last year, driven by cost reduction initiatives and lower accruals for bad debt.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Francis Blair","x":"Given the carryover of restructuring savings, other work that the team has done through 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Dicenza","x":"Overall, we are reaffirming the midpoint of our earnings guidance range of $5.25 as the better-than-expected third-quarter results are offsetting an incremental $0.05 per share headwind from tariffs and a lower outlook for the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q3","e":"tkr","d":"2025-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Dicenza","x":"With respect to net sales, we raised the full-year outlook by 50 basis points versus the midpoint of the prior guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/timken-tkr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2025 Q4","e":"tkr","d":"2026-02-04","l":"