iffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Discenza","x":"Note that our adjusted results include a net benefit for IEEPA tariff refunds of $8 million or $0.08 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/timken-tkr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2026 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Discenza","x":"Organically, incremental margins were more than 40% even without the benefit of the tariff refund.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/timken-tkr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2026 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Discenza","x":"As far as pricing goes, I -- we've not announced a price increase for July 1 this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/timken-tkr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2026 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Raso","x":"Just I mean, in the channel, we heard you had a 3.5% price increase for shipments after July 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/timken-tkr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2026 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lucian Boldea","x":"What I would say is we've had a track record over many years of rightsizing our footprint with market demand, and that's not going to be different going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/timken-tkr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2026 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Lucian Boldea","x":"Our performance during the first half of the year and continued momentum gives us the confidence to raise our full year guidance again.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/timken-tkr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKR 2026 Q2","e":"tkr","d":"2026-08-06","l":"gu